# Backend URL for the canvas API.
#
# Leave UNSET (or empty) for the bundled Docker install — the frontend
# calls /api/* as relative URLs, and Caddy inside the container proxies
# them to the Bun server on the same origin.
#
# Only set this for local dev where the frontend (`npm run dev`) talks to
# a Bun server on a different port:
#   VITE_CANVAS_API=http://localhost:8787
#
# Or for a hosted deployment where the frontend is served separately from
# the API (Cloudflare Pages + Worker, etc.).
